{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2113543891014348804","created_at":"2026-10-23T08:11:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113543891014348804"],"id":"2113543891014348804","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1512,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"比起在一起我更喜欢分开，比起互相珍惜我更珍惜彼此仇恨。甜蜜的时刻再怎么拥有都嫌弃不够多，但真的恨上彼此一辈子的概率不是比所谓永恒之爱有更大的概率么？\n我好像不太明白","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2113543891014348804"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2113540133001818294","created_at":"2026-10-23T07:56:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113540133001818294"],"id":"2113540133001818294","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1272,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"只要没有事情的时间就会想起你 先想你 再想起你已经不是我的了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2113540133001818294"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2113540014265249846","created_at":"2026-10-23T07:56:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113540014265249846"],"id":"2113540014265249846","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1668,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"text":"想象中的久别重逢就是在陌生街头上的偶遇，彼此都没有开口问候对方，只是长久地对视。久到仿佛这是看对方的最后一眼所以拼尽了全力把时间拉到最长。但其实现实你只会下意识扭头然后走远吧","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2113540014265249846"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2113270274707861721","created_at":"2026-10-22T14:04:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113270274707861721"],"id":"2113270274707861721","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1723,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"睡觉没有东西可以抱根本睡不着，我想充当一个叫kiri抱枕的东西","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2113270274707861721"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2113268006222716961","created_at":"2026-10-22T13:55:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113268006222716961"]