13116292677013674","created_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113116292677013674"],"id":"2113116292677013674","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":950,"impression_count":424223,"like_count":14027,"quote_count":298,"reply_count":669,"retweet_count":1574},"text":"我真得好好调教你了，让你必须每天睡九小时，一日三餐按时吃，一天喝八杯水，晚上十点前睡觉，饮食荤素均衡，时常运动出门晒太阳，完全变成健康生活的模样","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2113116292677013674"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112853263460814877","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:27:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112853263460814877"],"id":"2112853263460814877","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1504,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"宝宝你们给我打米米的时候私信敲敲我，然后我来亲亲你们好不好呀…至少让我知道让我幸福的宝宝是哪个🥺","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112853263460814877"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112852919532089570","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:26:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112852919532089570"],"id":"2112852919532089570","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":3589,"like_count":105,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":9},"text":"我感觉我头顶的达摩克利斯之剑已经把我砍的只剩半扇猪肉了，但是别人看我正面还以为毛事没有，其实只要转过去就能看见我惨烈的横截面","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112852919532089570"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112834579942039755","created_at":"2026-10-21T09:13:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112834579942039755"],"id":"2112834579942039755","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1537,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"家人究竟是什么？是纽带还是枷锁？我想变得不一样，可为什么，为什么变不了，好似越恨什么就越会变成什么。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112834579942039755"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112833929011159194","created_at":"2026-10-21T09:10:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112833929011159194"],"id":"2112833929011159194","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1393,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我不留在这里的话没有人记得发生过的事了，我不管这样做是不是正确的，我只想要留在这里","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112833929011159194"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112830144876531808","created_at":"2026-10-21T08:55:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112830144876531808"],"id":"2112830144876531808","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1287,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我觉得特别搞笑特别的黑色幽默这一切","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112830144876531808"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112830045211570634","created_at":"2026-10-21T08:55:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112830045211570634"],"id":"2112830045211570634","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1503,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"没有人守护我的天真，反而过去所有人都在逼我成熟，过早地经历着伤害，这是一种特别残忍的催熟手段来让我变得早熟，然后我又被迫接受所有人轻描淡写的夸赞我很坚强","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112830045211570634"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112826053458886877","created_at":"2026-10-21T08:39:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112826053458886877"],"id":"2112826053458886877","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":12695,"like_count":269,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":51},"text":"因为太粘人被踢到墙角粘老鼠去了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112826053458886877"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2112789732723962213","created_at":"2026-10-21T06:15:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112789732723962213"],"id":"2112789732723962213","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1527,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"在同龄人纷纷对人生进行未来规划的时候，我在对人生进行笑点解析，这就是我的人生观","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2112789732723962213"},{"author_id":"191704732699